{"seq":3,"slug":"overall-appraisal","title":"综合评价","docCount":2,"url":"/c/people/john-von-neumann/controversies-and-appraisal/overall-appraisal","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"a-universal-genius","title":"旷世的全才","url":"/c/people/john-von-neumann/controversies-and-appraisal/overall-appraisal/a-universal-genius","wordCount":1396,"readingTime":6},{"seq":2,"slug":"a-balanced-assessment","title":"全面的评判","url":"/c/people/john-von-neumann/controversies-and-appraisal/overall-appraisal/a-balanced-assessment","wordCount":1482,"readingTime":6}],"introMarkdown":"# 综合评价\n\n本章在客观审视争议的基础上，对冯·诺依曼做出全面的综合评价。一方面，充分肯定他作为\"旷世全才\"的卓越贡献与非凡智慧；另一方面，也客观地正视围绕其人生与贡献的争议。两篇文档，分别呈现旷世的全才，以及一个全面而辩证的评判。\n"}